name: mj_confidence_bypass
doc: >
  Adds a confidence table to Mockingjay. Confidence is incremented on a sampled
  reuse and decremented on a sampled eviction. Both static and dynamic bypass
  conditions are gated by high confidence to reduce wrong_bypass mistakes,
  a major source of error on some traces. This uses a simpler training scheme
  and a successful new word from a previous design.

state:
  - name: etr
    scope: per_line
